                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "1st review: Buyer beware, this is an old, crappy game that refuses to open on Windows 11 and has not been updated to do so.  I was able to get it to open the first time but, thereafter it wouldn't budge.....white screen only.  A waste of $ on this old clunker.\n\n2nd review: well, here's how to break into this game.  Go to Manage (the settings wheel for this game in the Steam library), hit Properties>Installed files>Browse>Game (click twice) and you can play.   But after long, laborious searches through the first 3 chapters, enough was enough....you have to \"intuitively\" know all the ingredients for making a pie or a weapon to ward off the monkeys, or how to make medicine, all without a recipe....with dozens of collected items from around the island.  After hours of seeking, mixing and matching, any shred of joy was gone.  I should have stopped before solving the mystery of how to play this in the first place.  Over and out!",
